{#- v3 site header. Owner: WS2 (built in Phase A, finished here).
    Outcome rules (CEO ruling, art direction section 4, engineering 4.1):
    - opaque black on every page from the first frame; constant height (--header-h 64 / 80);
    - the raised layer (ink-head plus a hairline) fades in by opacity only after about 8px of scroll;
    - the call control stays a tel: link in every state (engineering 3.2.2 header exception);
    - five text links on desktop (Car tint, Home and office, Windshield, Prices, Gallery); under 1024px
      they live in the menu sheet with the less used pages, the live status at the top and the call and
      text controls at the bottom (art direction H-f);
    - [data-bc-status] is the status word: space reserved, invisible until 30-actions.js fills it and
      adds .is-ready (plus .is-open or .is-closed); no word at all on an unknown day or without JS;
    - #v3-menu-btn and #v3-drawer are the ids 20-header.js binds.
    Wording: pages.shared.v3.actions.header. Phone: site.json phone. Logo: global data images._logo
    (images/v3/logo-120.png and .webp, 322 x 120, the real raster, 3x the 40px display height, never
    redrawn; class v3-logo-img). Front matter header_raised: true
    prints data-raised="always" (layer on from load). -#}
{%- from "v3/actions.njk" import action, statusChip with context -%}
{%- set w = pages.shared.v3.actions.header -%}
{%- set curUrl = (page.url or "/") | replace(r/index\.html$/, "") | replace(r/\.html$/, "") | replace(r/\/+$/, "") -%}
{%- if not curUrl %}{% set curUrl = "/" %}{% endif -%}
<header class="v3-header" data-v3-header{% if header_raised %} data-raised="always"{% endif %}>
  <div class="v3-header__in wrap">
    <a class="v3-logo" href="/"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="{{ images._logo.webp | safe }}"><img class="v3-logo-img" src="{{ images._logo.png | safe }}" width="{{ images._logo.width }}" height="{{ images._logo.height }}" alt="{{ w.logo_alt | safe }}" decoding="async"></picture></a>
    <nav class="v3-nav" aria-label="{{ w.nav_label | safe }}">
{%- for l in w.nav %}
      <a href="{{ l.href | safe }}"{% if curUrl == l.href or (l.href != "/" and curUrl.indexOf(l.href + "/") == 0) %} aria-current="page"{% endif %}>{{ l.label | safe }}</a>
{%- endfor %}
    </nav>
    <div class="v3-header__cta">
      {{ statusChip({ form: "short" }) }}
      <a class="v3-header__tel tnum" href="tel:{{ site.phone.tel | safe }}">{{ site.phone.display_call | safe }}</a>
      {{ action({ slot: "header" }) }}
      <button type="button" class="v3-menubtn" id="v3-menu-btn" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="v3-drawer" data-open-label="{{ w.menu_label | safe }}" data-close-label="{{ w.close_label | safe }}"><span class="v3-menubtn__t">{{ w.menu_label | safe }}</span></button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <nav class="v3-drawer" id="v3-drawer" aria-label="{{ w.menu_label | safe }}" hidden>
    {{ statusChip({ form: "long" }) }}
{%- for l in w.nav %}
    <a href="{{ l.href | safe }}"{% if curUrl == l.href or (l.href != "/" and curUrl.indexOf(l.href + "/") == 0) %} aria-current="page"{% endif %}>{{ l.label | safe }}</a>
{%- endfor %}
{%- for l in w.drawer_extra %}
    <a class="v3-drawer__minor" href="{{ l.href | safe }}">{{ l.label | safe }}</a>
{%- endfor %}
    {{ action({ slot: "drawer", service: "any", on_book: (slug == "book" or on_book) }) }}
  </nav>
</header>
